  _name: Red Slime Cleanup
  _description: Kill 10 red slimes
  _storyDescription: Red slime is getting into the wells and sticking to absolutely everything. Please remove ten of them.
  _activeQuestDialogue: 'Red slime is getting into the wells. Please remove ten of them before the whole town is covered in it.'
  _turnInDialogue: 'The wells are clear of red slime again. You protected the village water supply, and we will not forget it.'
  _completedQuestDialogueLines:
  - 'The wells are safe from the red slime again. The villagers can drink in peace.'
  - 'Ten red slimes gone, and only a little less slime on everything. Thank you.'
  - 'You kept the slime out of our water. That means a lot to this village.'
